  "",
  "2. DIVISION OF RESPONSIBILITY (GRAPHIC vs CAPTION):",
  "   - THE GRAPHIC is an architectural poster: striking hook headline, clean Swiss cards, page number, @developmentserhat branding.",
  "   - THE INSTAGRAM CAPTION is where the deep, comprehensive, detailed value lives (rendered natively by Instagram with perfect typography).",
  "",
  "3. CAPTION QUALITY & EDITORIAL RIGOR (IN ENGLISH):",
  "   - Hook: Arresting, scroll-stopping first sentence with an intriguing contrast or quote.",
  "   - Problem / Context: Mature analysis explaining the landscape, trade-offs, and practical reality.",
  "   - Solution Framework: Numbered pillars with emojis ('01 · ...', '02 · ...') comparing models/points objectively.",
  "   - Call To Action: Clear directive ('👉 Save this guide for your next build. Follow @developmentserhat for more AI engineering insights.').",
  "   - Hashtags: 12-15 curated English tech & strategy hashtags separated by spaces.",
  "",
  "4. FLUX PROMPT SPECIFICATION (FOR MAXIMUM RESOLUTION & FIDELITY):",
  "   - Format: Square 1:1, 1080x1080 native Instagram resolution.",
  "   - Background: Warm textured fine-art paper or architectural ivory parchment (#fafaf7), hairline borders (#e4e7e0).",
